Recommends: nvidia-cuda-toolkit
Description: Voice dictation for GNOME with local AI transcription
 Dictator enables system-wide voice-to-text functionality for GNOME desktops.
 Uses OpenAI's Whisper AI model locally for 100% private transcription.
 .
 Features:
  - Toggle recording with Ctrl+Shift+Space
  - Works in any application (Wayland and X11)
  - GPU acceleration support (NVIDIA CUDA)
  - No cloud services or data transmission
  - Lightweight and fast with local processing
